 Should this todo be here? Seems to belong to the `OverrideNewTabSplitMode` test -- it could be left behind once that test is updated"],["58eaecd1_f50f40cd",17,-21,1,"use `profile()`, which is available on Desktop Android (here and in other places on this test)"],["82f828ba_38c82a21",17,-6,1,"nit: s/actual/default"],["89b9d27b_7fe8f06c",17,-6,1,"nit: I think we probably want WaitForExtensionLoaded() instead of Installed()"],["968d5dcd_589e8ba7",17,-6,1,"nit: const&"],["b544c766_e18f19be",17,-6,1,"The visible entry might not be sufficient here. The visible entry corresponds to the entry we show to users in the omnibox which, for an overridden newtab, can still be chrome://newtab. (Out of…"],["fcbd8ecd_6baf12fb",17,-6,1,"nit: maybe `if the \"incognito\" manifest key is unspecified` to be a bit more specific?"]],0,397],[7233305,20432,913,9.607,7.821,[[7,0.501,76,881],[8,0.498,91,877],[6,0.001,115,1]],[["7d761fdc_b8f7ed83",18,-2,0,"in the IDL, this was _interface -- I didn't realize we had special handling for that. Are there other cases of it? Something to be cleaned up?"],["f8ac7a49_f969f493",18,-2,1,"nit: mind helping this to wrap at 80 char? Ditto below"]],0,398],[7139819,20434,29,0.737,0.556,[[14,97]],[["6b805668_35164482",17,0,1,"\"... since we need to ensure users see details about what incognito is (and isn't)\""],["9ae33da2_4e1ba95c",19,0,1,"possibly drop the same comment here"],["f1f20a94_2c2bcd47",19,0,1,"nit: does just host() work to avoid the construction of a separate string?"]],0,399],[7249410,20437,72,2.212,1.739,[[15,0.5,1,40],[7,0.337,77,21],[9,0.163,85,11]],[["f12efb1a_31a81096",20,-2,0,"Can you quickly double-check (if you haven't) the generated code for this and ensure that it will return false for any malformed-but-present dictionary, even if it's optional?"]],0,400],[7264494,20439,39,1.22,0.938,[[6,0.905,116,36],[8,0.095,92,3]],[],0,401],[7263510,20439,135,3.856,3.092,[[8,0.762,93,104],[6,0.238,117,31]],[],0,402],[7265378,20439,51,1.22,0.938,[[7,0